# swarm-yml-pool: /swarm pool validate + list must reflect a pool configured in .pi/swarm.yml.
# Lane recipe (tmux): scratch dir with .pi/swarm.yml only (mock-llm slots), then
#   pi --provider mock-llm --model swarm-yml-pool -e ./extensions/mock-llm -e ./extensions/swarm
# Expected surface: validate PASSES with source swarm.yml (explicit-pool, 2 slots); list shows
# both mock slots; no settings.json swarm block is created by reading (scaffold may create the
# yml placeholder only when no pool is declared — here one IS declared, so no write at all).
